error[E0068]: the constant `quiet` has a type that contains a function
  --> tests/ui/04-declarations/constants/log_logger_constant.cheby:10:14
   |
10 | const quiet: log::Logger = log::silent_logger()
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^ this type contains `fn(log::Record) -> Nil`
